      "settings": {
        "custom_liquid": "{%- comment -%}\n  ============================================================\n  BORDADERÍA · Sección Hero\n  Pegar en: Personalizar tema → Añadir sección → Liquid personalizado\n  Todo lo editable está en las variables CSS de :root del bloque <style>.\n  ============================================================\n{%- endcomment -%}\n\n{%- assign hero_img = 'https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/1042/9605/5067/files/img_hero.png?v=1786125969' -%}\n\n<link rel=\"preload\" as=\"image\" href=\"{{ hero_img }}\">\n\n<section class=\"brd-hero\" role=\"banner\" aria-label=\"Bordados con precisión digital\">\n  <div class=\"brd-hero__inner\">\n    <h1 class=\"brd-hero__title\">\n      <span class=\"brd-hero__line brd-hero__line--dark\">Bordados con Precisión Digital.</span>\n      <span class=\"brd-hero__line brd-hero__line--accent\">Tu estilo, puntada a puntada.</span>\n    </h1>\n\n    {%- comment -%}\n      ¿Quieres un botón? Descomenta este bloque y cambia el enlace.\n    {%- endcomment -%}\n    {%- comment -%}\n    <a class=\"brd-hero__cta\" href=\"/collections/all\">Ver camisetas</a>\n    {%- endcomment -%}\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n<style>\n  /* --- quita el espacio que el tema añade alrededor de la sección --- */\n  .shopify-section:has(.brd-hero) {\n    padding-top: 0 !important;\n    padding-bottom: 0 !important;\n    margin-top: 0 !important;\n    margin-bottom: 0 !important;\n  }\n  .shopify-section:has(.brd-hero) > *:not(.brd-hero) {\n    padding-top: 0 !important;\n    padding-bottom: 0 !important;\n    margin-top: 0 !important;\n    margin-bottom: 0 !important;\n  }\n\n  .brd-hero {\n    /* ---------- ajustes rápidos ---------- */\n    --hero-image: url(\"{{ hero_img }}\");\n    --hero-color-dark: #1B1B19;      /* primera línea */\n    --hero-color-accent: #1A4EE0;    /* segunda línea (azul) */\n    --hero-height: clamp(320px, 47vw, 620px);\n    --hero-font-size: clamp(20px, 2.7vw, 36px);\n    --hero-focus-x: 50%;             /* encuadre horizontal de la foto */\n    --hero-focus-y: 50%;             /* encuadre vertical de la foto */\n    --hero-text-shift: -4%;          /* sube el texto respecto al centro */\n    --hero-scrim: 0;                 /* 0 = sin velo; sube a .35 si el texto no se lee */\n    /* ------------------------------------- */\n\n    position: relative;\n    box-sizing: border-box;\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: center;\n\n    /* ancho completo aunque el tema envuelva la sección en un contenedor */\n    width: 100vw;\n    max-width: 100vw;\n    margin-left: calc(50% - 50vw);\n    margin-right: calc(50% - 50vw);\n\n    min-height: var(--hero-height);\n    padding: 5vw 24px;\n\n    background-image: var(--hero-image);\n    background-size: cover;\n    background-position: var(--hero-focus-x) var(--hero-focus-y);\n    background-repeat: no-repeat;\n    background-color: #F3F0EB; /* color de respaldo mientras carga */\n  }\n\n  /* velo opcional para mejorar la legibilidad */\n  .brd-hero::after {\n    content: \"\";\n    position: absolute;\n    inset: 0;\n    background: #FFFFFF;\n    opacity: var(--hero-scrim);\n    pointer-events: none;\n  }\n\n  .brd-hero__inner {\n    position: relative;\n    z-index: 1;\n    max-width: 760px;\n    text-align: center;\n    transform: translateY(var(--hero-text-shift));\n  }\n\n  .brd-hero__title {\n    margin: 0;\n    padding: 0;\n    font-family: inherit;\n    font-size: var(--hero-font-size);\n    font-weight: 600;\n    line-height: 1.32;\n    letter-spacing: -0.01em;\n    text-transform: none;\n  }\n\n  .brd-hero__line {\n    display: block;\n  }\n\n  .brd-hero__line--dark   { color: var(--hero-color-dark); }\n  .brd-hero__line--accent { color: var(--hero-color-accent); }\n\n  .brd-hero__cta {\n    display: inline-block;\n    margin-top: 28px;\n    padding: 14px 34px;\n    border: 1px solid var(--hero-color-dark);\n    border-radius: 2px;\n    background: var(--hero-color-dark);\n    color: #FFFFFF;\n    font-size: 14px;\n    font-weight: 500;\n    letter-spacing: 0.12em;\n    text-transform: uppercase;\n    text-decoration: none;\n    transition: background-color .25s ease, color .25s ease;\n  }\n\n  .brd-hero__cta:hover {\n    background: transparent;\n    color: var(--hero-color-dark);\n  }\n\n  /* ---------- móvil ---------- */\n  @media screen and (max-width: 749px) {\n    .brd-hero {\n      --hero-height: 62vh;\n      --hero-font-size: clamp(19px, 5.4vw, 26px);\n      --hero-text-shift: -2%;\n      padding: 32px 20px;\n    }\n    .brd-hero__inner { max-width: 22ch; }\n  }\n\n  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {\n    .brd-hero__cta { transition: none; }\n  }\n</style>",
